#: ../../source/reference/animator.rst:13
msgid ""
"The animation controller allows to control different animation states "
"from AnimationStateMachine assets. To use any animations in the Thunder "
"Engine the Animator must be attached to a root Actor in the hierarchy. "
"The animation controller processes an AnimationStateMachine resource "
"type. The animation controller can use parametric values to decide when "
"transition between states must happen."
msgstr ""

